Custom Service", type UDP, port som vist, IP denne enheten.\nBruk.', 'uk': 'Відкрий routerlogin.net, увійди.\nВідкрий "ADVANCED" → "Advanced Setup" → "Port Forwarding".\nВибери "Add Custom Service", тип UDP, порт як показано, IP — цей пристрій.\nЗастосуй.', 'ru': 'Открой routerlogin.net, войди.\nОткрой "ADVANCED" → "Advanced Setup" → "Port Forwarding".\nВыбери "Add Custom Service", тип UDP, порт как показано, IP — это устройство.\nПримени.', 'tr': 'routerlogin.net adresini aç, oturum aç.\n"ADVANCED" → "Advanced Setup" → "Port Forwarding" aç.\n"Add Custom Service" seç, tür UDP, port gösterildiği gibi, IP bu cihaz.\nUygula.', 'zh': '打开 routerlogin.net，登录。\n"ADVANCED" → "Advanced Setup" → "Port Forwarding"。\n"Add Custom Service"，类型 UDP，端口如此处所示，IP 为本设备。\n应用更改。', 'ja': 'routerlogin.net を開き、ログインする。\n"ADVANCED" → "Advanced Setup" → "Port Forwarding"。\n"Add Custom Service"、タイプ UDP、ポートは表示のとおり、IP はこの端末。\n適用する。', 'ko': 'routerlogin.net 페이지를 열고 로그인합니다.\n"ADVANCED" → "Advanced Setup" → "Port Forwarding".\n"Add Custom Service", 유형 UDP, 포트는 표시된 값, IP는 이 기기.\n적용합니다.', 'hi': 'routerlogin.net खोलें, लॉग इन करें।\n"ADVANCED" → "Advanced Setup" → "Port Forwarding" खोलें।\n"Add Custom Service" चुनें, टाइप UDP, पोर्ट जैसा दिखाया गया है, IP यह डिवाइस।\nलागू करें।', 'th': 'เปิด routerlogin.net แล้วเข้าสู่ระบบ\n"ADVANCED" → "Advanced Setup" → "Port Forwarding"\n"Add Custom Service" ชนิด UDP พอร์ตตามที่แสดง IP คืออุปกรณ์นี้\nกดใช้งาน', 'vi': 'Mở routerlogin.net, đăng nhập.\n"ADVANCED" → "Advanced Setup" → "Port Forwarding".\n"Add Custom Service", Loại UDP, cổng như hiển thị, IP là thiết bị này.\nÁp dụng.', 'id': 'Buka routerlogin.net, masuk.\n"ADVANCED" → "Advanced Setup" → "Port Forwarding".\n"Add Custom Service", Tipe UDP, port seperti yang ditampilkan, IP perangkat ini.\nTerapkan.', 'ms': 'Buka routerlogin.net, log masuk.\n"ADVANCED" → "Advanced Setup" → "Port Forwarding".\n"Add Custom Service", Jenis UDP, port seperti yang dipaparkan, IP peranti ini.\nGuna pakai.', 'sr': 'Отвори routerlo