  'nat_wizard_steps_asus_rt_ax55': {'de': 'router.asus.com oder 192.168.1.1 öffnen, anmelden.\n"WAN" → Reiter "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nNeuen Eintrag: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range wie angezeigt, lokale IP dieses Geräts, Protokoll UDP.\nÜbernehmen.', 'en': 'Open router.asus.com or 192.168.1.1, log in.\n"WAN" → tab "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nAdd entry: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range as shown, Local IP of this device, Protocol UDP.\nApply.', 'es': 'Abre router.asus.com o 192.168.1.1, inicia sesión.\n"WAN" → pestaña "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nNueva entrada: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range como se muestra, IP local, Protocolo UDP.\nAplicar.', 'hu': 'Nyisd meg a router.asus.com vagy a 192.168.1.1 címet, jelentkezz be.\n"WAN" → "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding" fül.\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nVegyél fel bejegyzést: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range a megjelenítettek szerint, ennek az eszköznek a helyi IP-címe, protokoll UDP.\nAlkalmazd.', 'sv': 'Öppna router.asus.com eller 192.168.1.1, logga in.\n"WAN" → fliken "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nLägg till en post: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range som visas, lokal IP för den här enheten, protokoll UDP.\nVerkställ.', 'ar': 'افتح router.asus.com أو 192.168.1.1 وسجّل الدخول.\nافتح "WAN" → علامة التبويب "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\nاضبط "Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nأضف إدخالًا: Service Name "Cleona"، Port Range كما هو معروض، الـ IP المحلي لهذا الجهاز، البروتوكول UDP.\nطبّق.', 'he': 'פתח את router.asus.com או 192.168.1.1 והתחבר.\nפתח את "WAN" → לשונית "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\nהגדר "Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nהוסף רשומה: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range כפי שמוצג, ה-IP המקומי של המכשיר הזה, פרוטוקול UDP.\nהחל.', 'fa': 'router.asus.com یا 192.168.1.1 را باز کنید و وارد شوید.\nمسیر "WAN" → زبانه "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding" را باز کنید.\nمقدار "Enable Port Forwarding: Yes" را تنظیم کنید.\nیک ورودی بیفزایید: Service Name "Cleona"، Port Range همان‌طور که نشان داده شده، نشانی محلی همین دستگاه، پروتکل UDP.\nاعمال کنید.', 'fr': 'Ouvrir router.asus.com ou 192.168.1.1, se connecter.\n"WAN" → onglet "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nNouvelle entrée : Service Name "Cleona", Port Range comme affiché, IP locale, Protocole UDP.\nAppliquer.', 'it': 'Apri router.asus.com o 192.168.1.1, accedi.\n"WAN" → scheda "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nAggiungi una voce: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range come indicato, IP locale di questo dispositivo, Protocollo UDP.\nApplica.', 'pt': 'Abre router.asus.com ou 192.168.1.1, inicia sessão.\n"WAN" → separador "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nAdiciona uma entrada: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range como indicado, IP local deste dispositivo, Protocolo UDP.\nAplica.', 'nl': 'Open router.asus.com of 192.168.1.1, meld je aan.\n"WAN" → tabblad "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nVoeg een item toe: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range zoals weergegeven, lokaal IP van dit apparaat, protocol UDP.\nToepassen.', 'pl': 'Otwórz router.asus.com lub 192.168.1.1, zaloguj się.\n"WAN" → karta "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nDodaj wpis: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range jak pokazano, lokalny IP tego urządzenia, Protokół UDP.\nZastosuj.', 'ro': 'Deschide router.asus.com sau 192.168.1.1, autentifică-te.\n"WAN" → fila "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nAdaugă o intrare: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range ca cel afișat, IP-ul local al acestui dispozitiv, Protocol UDP.\nAplică.', 'cs': 'Otevři router.asus.com nebo 192.168.1.1, přihlas se.\n"WAN" → záložka "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nPřidej záznam: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range jak je uvedeno, místní IP tohoto zařízení, Protokol UDP.\nPoužij.', 'sk': 'Otvor router.asus.com alebo 192.168.1.1, prihlás sa.\n"WAN" → záložka "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nPridaj záznam: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range ako je uvedené, lokálna IP tohto zariadenia, Protokol UDP.\nPouži.', 'hr': 'Otvori router.asus.com ili 192.168.1.1, prijavi se.\n"WAN" → kartica "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nDodaj stavku: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range kao što je prikazano, lokalni IP ovog uređaja, Protokol UDP.\nPrimijeni.', 'bg': 'Отвори router.asus.com или 192.168.1.1, влез.\nОтвори "WAN" → раздел "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\nЗадай "Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nДобави запис: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range както е показано, локалния IP на това устройство, протокол UDP.\nПриложи.', 'el': 'Άνοιξε το router.asus.com ή το 192.168.1.1, συνδέσου.\n"WAN" → καρτέλα "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nΠρόσθεσε καταχώριση: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range όπως εμφανίζεται, τοπική IP αυτής της συσκευής, πρωτόκολλο UDP.\nΕφάρμοσε.', 'da': 'Åbn router.asus.com eller 192.168.1.1, log ind.\n"WAN" → fanen "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nTilføj en post: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range som vist, lokal IP for denne enhed, protokol UDP.\nAnvend.', 'fi': 'Avaa router.asus.com tai 192.168.1.1, kirjaudu sisään.\n"WAN" → välilehti "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nLisää merkintä: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range kuten näytetään, tämän laitteen paikallinen IP, protokolla UDP.\nOta käyttöön.', 'no': 'Åpne router.asus.com eller 192.168.1.1, logg inn.\n"WAN" → fanen "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nLegg til en oppføring: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range som vist, lokal IP for denne enheten, protokoll UDP.\nBruk.', 'uk': 'Відкрий router.asus.com або 192.168.1.1, увійди.\nВідкрий "WAN" → вкладка "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\nВстанови "Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nДодай запис: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range як показано, локальний IP цього пристрою, протокол UDP.\nЗастосуй.', 'ru': 'Открой router.asus.com или 192.168.1.1, войди.\nОткрой "WAN" → вкладка "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\nУстанови "Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nДобавь запись: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range как показано, локальный IP этого устройства, протокол UDP.\nПримени.', 'tr': 'router.asus.com veya 192.168.1.1 adresini aç, oturum aç.\n"WAN" → "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding" sekmesini aç.\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes" olarak ayarla.\nKayıt ekle: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range gösterildiği gibi, bu cihazın yerel IP adresi, protokol UDP.\nUygula.', 'zh': '打开 router.asus.com 或 192.168.1.1，登录。\n"WAN" → 选项卡 "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding"。\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes"。\n新增条目：Service Name "Cleona"，Port Range 如此处所示，Local IP 为本设备，协议 UDP。\n应用更改。', 'ja': 'router.asus.com または 192.168.1.1 を開き、ログインする。\n"WAN" → タブ "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding"。\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes"。\nエントリーを追加する: Service Name "Cleona"、Port Range は表示のとおり、Local IP はこの端末、プロトコル UDP。\n適用する。', 'ko': 'router.asus.com 또는 192.168.1.1을 열고 로그인합니다.\n"WAN" → 탭 "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\n항목 추가: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range는 표시된 값, Local IP는 이 기기, 프로토콜 UDP.\n적용합니다.', 'hi': 'router.asus.com या 192.168.1.1 खोलें, लॉग इन करें।\n"WAN" → टैब "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding" खोलें।\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes" सेट करें।\nएंट्री जोड़ें: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range जैसा दिखाया गया है, इस डिवाइस का लोकल IP, प्रोटोकॉल UDP।\nलागू करें।', 'th': 'เปิด router.asus.com หรือ 192.168.1.1 แล้วเข้าสู่ระบบ\n"WAN" → แท็บ "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding"\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes"\nเพิ่มรายการ: Service Name "Cleona" Port Range ตามที่แสดง Local IP ของอุปกรณ์นี้ โปรโตคอล UDP\nกดใช้งาน', 'vi': 'Mở router.asus.com hoặc 192.168.1.1, đăng nhập.\n"WAN" → thẻ "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nThêm mục: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range như hiển thị, Local IP của thiết bị này, Giao thức UDP.\nÁp dụng.', 'id': 'Buka router.asus.com atau 192.168.1.1, masuk.\n"WAN" → tab "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nTambahkan entri: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range seperti yang ditampilkan, Local IP perangkat ini, Protokol UDP.\nTerapkan.', 'ms': 'Buka router.asus.com atau 192.168.1.1, log masuk.\n"WAN" → tab "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nTambah entri: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range seperti yang dipaparkan, Local IP peranti ini, Protokol UDP.\nGuna pakai.', 'sr': 'Отвори router.asus.com или 192.168.1.1, пријави се.\n"WAN" → таб "Virtual Server / Port Forwarding".\n"Enable Port Forwarding: Yes".\nДодај ставку: Service Name "Cleona", Port Range као што је приказано, локални IP овог уређаја, Протокол UDP.\nПримени.', },
